+| Lemmas 3.4/3.5 | **VERIFIED** | The generic fiber is the finite field extension \(k(x,y)/k(P,Q)\), so \(k(Y_0)=k(X_0)\) and \(\rho\) is birational. The two lemmas duplicate one another. |
